  <documents xsi:type="kernel:StructuredDocument" id="0eff57ef-b2e0-5b71-afa2-dae354675bf3" name="Developer completion and demo boundary" format="MARKDOWN" content="Map itemCode/availableQty/itemVersion deterministically to sku/stockAvailable/sourceVersion; quantities are nonnegative integers.&#10;Newest full snapshot wins per SKU; older snapshots never revert destination stock.&#10;Stable exchange ID and payload hash resolve timeout-after-commit; provider 429 is retriable, malformed contracts fail permanently.&#10;Operator replay is authorized and audited; simulators use controlled study endpoints and credentials.&#10;Generated function shells require real Go application code. Review endpoint reachability, resource permissions, contracts and naming before deployment." description="Reviewed demonstration model; not a deployment/acceptance certificate" />
